sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant HO as Human Owner
  participant EK as eKYC/Issuer
  participant CW as didKYC Cold Wallet
  participant AG as AI Agent
  participant PG as Payment Gateway
  participant VE as DID/VC Verifier
  participant PE as Policy Engine
  participant BS as Hyperledger Besu
  participant AU as Audit Store

  HO->>EK: Complete initial eKYC onboarding
  EK-->>HO: Identity approved
  EK->>CW: Issue VC bound to owner's DID
  CW-->>HO: VC and DID reference stored

  Note over AG,CW: Payment session starts (daily cap <= HK$100)
  AG->>CW: Request delegated signing authorization
  CW-->>AG: Issue short-lived delegated key/session token

  AG->>PG: Open Agentic Payment Button flow
  PG-->>AG: Return payment requirements + challenge
  AG->>VE: Submit DID proof + VC presentation
  VE->>VE: Validate signature, issuer trust, expiry, revocation
  VE-->>PE: Verification result + assurance level

  PE->>PE: Evaluate policy (daily limit, merchant allow-list, anomalies)
  alt Verification + policy pass
    PE-->>AG: Authorization granted
    AG->>BS: Submit signed transaction (delegated key)
    BS-->>PG: Settlement finality event
    PG-->>AG: Payment success confirmation
    PG->>AU: Store hashes, policy decision, verification refs
  else Verification or policy fail
    PE-->>AG: Reject with reason code
    PG->>AU: Store denial record + risk flags
  end